if {Fiona.HasSpoken} == false:
	Devin: Fiona Sharp?
	Fiona: Well met, good sir. I presume you’re the masked venator my father hired.
	Devin: In the flesh.
	Fiona: Aye. Well I’m rather busy. Difficult times of late, as you well know. Perchance you have come to serve?
	Devin: I’m here for questions, Miss Sharp.
	Fiona: I suspect others might be more help, but pray, continue if you must.
	set {Fiona.HasSpoken} = true
else:
	if {Fiona.ItemGiven} == false:
		if {Fiona.SetANecklaceAsked} == true:
			Devin: Miss Sharp.
			Fiona: I haven’t the time, there are more important matters at hand than your inane questions.
			[end_timeline]
		else:
			Devin: Miss Sharp.
			Fiona: Yes, hunter?
	else:
		Devin: Miss Sharp.
		Fiona: Yes, hunter. How may I be of assistance?
if {Fiona.ItemGiven} == false:
	if {Fiona.SetANecklaceAsked} == false:
		label Questions
		- Strange deaths and disappearances. Notice anything unusual?
			Devin: Bodies lie dead in the fields. They are savaged. Tell me what you have noticed of late?
			Fiona: I pray you don’t think me blithe, but I cannot think of anything for certain. If it pleases the Lord, we’ll have fewer such deaths anon.
			jump Questions
		- Tell me about your mother, Beth.
			Devin: Your mother has been missing for some months. I must ask —
			Fiona: Yes. Apologies, hunter. But I can hardly get my thoughts together. I worry so.
			jump Questions
		- Your family is short a necklace. What do you know?
			Devin: What can you tell me of the necklace that has vanished and its fate?
			Fiona: Strange that it has gone missing, stranger yet that you consider it relevant. If you don’t mind, I must carry on with our important work.
			Devin: Miss Sharp, need I remind you that people are dying in the fields — I must do what I can.
			Fiona: And I must do what I can for townsfolk dying in the streets daily. Fare thee well, hunter.
			set {Fiona.SetANecklaceAsked} = true
			[end_timeline]
		- I’ll be on my way
			Devin: I should take my leave.
			Fiona: Godspeed, hunter.
			[end_timeline]
else:
	ADD SET B dialogue here
